  "text": "## PART 5: How to Sell Products  \n### The Discovery Questions  \nBefore recommending a product, ask:\n1. **What's your main banking need?** (Savings? Checking? Borrowing?)\n2. **Do you want to save or spend?**\n3. **How often will you access the money?**\n4. **Are you interested in earning interest?**\n5. **Do you have other bank accounts?**",
